# Tudo Sobre Cannabis — layout / UI reference

When changing the presentation layer of the web app, treat
`docs/visual/kit-moderno/01-diretrizes/STYLE-GUIDE.md` and `docs/BRAND.md`
as the visual source of truth. Tokens live in `web/src/app/globals.css`.
Brand assets: `web/public/brand/`. Font: Manrope in `web/src/app/fonts/`.

- Preserve editorial content, Markdown sources, existing routes, pipelines and data shapes.
- Prefer visual polish over structural redesign; keep the current home/post layout bones.
- Use Manrope for titles, reading and UI (weights 400 / 700 / 800).
- Use paper `#F7F5EB`, ink `#073F35`, lime `#D4F08A`, kicker `#9E422D` from the kit tokens.
- Article cards and hero feature use `image:` cover WebP; botanical brand art is fallback only.
- Do not add a metrics strip to the hero.
- Keep focus styles, responsive behavior and existing semantic structure intact.

The former `replit-layout-provisorio/` package is retired.
